SUMMARY:Jorge Drexler
LOCATION:Roundhouse\, Primrose Hill
DESCRIPTION:Uruguayan musician\, composer\, and singer Jorge Drexler - one 
 
of the most influential voices in contemporary Ibero-American music - takes
 
 to the stage to present his latest album\, TARACÁ (released March 2026). 
 
Renowned for a career defined by curiosity\, experimentation\, and deep poe
 
tic sensitivity\, Drexler returns with a brand-new live show. Accompanied b
 
y a seven-piece band and featuring a completely reimagined stage production
 
\, the performance centers on the rhythms of Uruguayan candombe. Fans can e
 
xpect a repertoire featuring the new sounds of TARACÁ alongside beloved cl
 
assics from his extensive discography. TARACÁ finally belongs to you - joi
 
n us for this exclusive London show at the iconic Roundhouse to cross the b
 
ridges Jorge has built. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.co.uk/jorg
 
e-drexler-london-27-10-2026/event/1F006487EAD14C73
URL:https://www.ticketmaster.co.uk/jorge-drexler-london-27-10-2026/event/1F
 
006487EAD14C73
